<title>BRAZIL: Banerj sale subject to new rules - report.</title>
<headline>Banerj sale subject to new rules - report.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian state of Rio de Janeiro has set new rules for the privatization of Banco do Estado do Rio de Janeiro SA (Banerj), which could be auctioned off as early as mid-April, Invest News said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The news service quoted Planning Secretary Marco Aurelio Alencar as saying officials wanted the bank to be sold to a single buyer. State officials could not be reached to confirm the report.</p>
<p>Late last year, Rio de Janeiro suspended the sale of Banerj on two separate occasions.</p>
<p>((--John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248-5414))</p>
